## Bug #17 disclosure
vercel CLI prepends progress lines (e.g., 'Fetching deployment ...') before
JSON on Windows. Get-JsonBody strips via earliest '{' or '[' index. Not
wording-dependent. Applied to vercel ls, vercel inspect, gh api defensively.
#
## C' cross-check limitation (Reviewer approved)
C' verifies (a) prod SHA exists on GitHub, (b) commit message matches Vercel
metadata. Does NOT prove GitHub saw Vercel deploy. Current-live proof is B
(URL-match + alias-match). C' is consistency check, not current-live proof.
